    "title": {
      "en": "Motes of Unstable Magic Now Soulbound in WoW: Forever - Gold Strategy Nerfed",
      "es": "Las partículas de magia inestable ahora están vinculadas al alma en WoW: Forever - Se ha debilitado la estrategia del oro"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Motes of Unstable Magic Now Soulbound in WoW: Forever - Gold Strategy Nerfed...",
      "es": "Las partículas de magia inestable ahora están vinculadas al alma en WoW: Forever - Se ha debilitado la estrategia del oro..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aff6c551a11f2.59739562\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Motes of Unstable Magic are now soulbound, preventing high-level players from selling them on the Auction House.<br><br>Once you reach level 48, players can obtain the <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=96603/unstable-magic\"><img alt=\"Unstable Magic\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt icon-alliance\">Unstable Magic</span></a> in Dalaran or <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=98477/unstable-magic\"><img alt=\"Unstable Magic\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt icon-horde\">Unstable Magic</span></a> at the Skywatcher Plateau. This quest gives players a <a class=\"q2 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=281371/elemental-attractor\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Elemental Attractor\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_shawaterelemental_reform.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Elemental Attractor</span></a>, and when used, it gives the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=1297774/magical-awareness\" class=\"icontiny\" data-entity=\"spell\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_10_dungeonjewelry_dragon_trinket_2arcanemagical_blue.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Magical Awareness</span></a> buff. This buff will sometimes grant players a <a class=\"q1 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274964/mote-of-unstable-magic\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Mote of Unstable Magic\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_elemental_primal_mana.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Mote of Unstable Magic</span></a> when they defeat spellcasters or bosses. After you complete the initial quest, a repeatable quest (e.g. <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=98476/more-unstable-magic\"><img alt=\"More Unstable Magic\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt icon-horde\">More Unstable Magic</span></a>) allows players to turn in another 10 Motes for reputation and <span class=\"moneysilver\">65</span>. <br><br>Because these were previously tradeable, each Mote was worth roughly <span class=\"moneysilver\">13</span>. Players could buy these off the Auction House at this price to get reputation while losing no money. This quest stops being available at Honored, but players could continue getting drops and selling the Motes for extra Gold. Many players made a lot of gold from selling these, but this income has been cut off.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Motes of Unstable Magic Soulbound\" width=\"285\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/56189.png\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.507936507936508\"></div><br><br>As of about noon Pacific time, Motes of Unstable Magic are now Soulbound. Players will now have to farm all of the Motes that they want for themselves and any extra motes farmed past Honored will be vendored at <span class=\"moneysilver\">2</span>. While it's unknown exactly why this was made to be Soulbound, one theory is that it's due to the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/100-gold-per-hour-farm-nerfed-in-wow-forever-383898\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Blackmaw Hold farm</a>. The Devotees dropped a lot of Motes of Unstable Magic, which would have injected a lot of them into the economy.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Motes of Unstable Magic are now soulbound, preventing high-level players from selling them on the Auction House.<br /><br />Once you reach level 48, players can obtain the <a href=\"/forever/quest=96603/unstable-magic\">Unstable Magic</a> in Dalaran or <a href=\"/forever/quest=98477/unstable-magic\">Unstable Magic</a> at the Skywatcher Plateau. This quest gives players a <a href=\"/forever/item=281371/elemental-attractor\">Elemental Attractor</a>, and when used, it gives the <a href=\"/forever/spell=1297774/magical-awareness\">Magical Awareness</a> buff. This buff will sometimes grant players a <a href=\"/forever/item=274964/mote-of-unstable-magic\">Mote of Unstable Magic</a> when they defeat spellcasters or bosses. After you complete the initial quest, a repeatable quest (e.g. <a href=\"/forever/quest=98476/more-unstable-magic\">More Unstable Magic</a>) allows players to turn in another 10 Motes for reputation and . <br /><br />Because these were previously tradeable, each Mote was worth roughly . Players could buy these off the Auction House at this price to get reputation while losing no money. This quest stops being available at Honored, but players could continue getting drops and selling the Motes for extra Gold. Many players made a lot of gold from selling these, but this income has been cut off.<br /><br />As of about noon Pacific time, Motes of Unstable Magic are now Soulbound. Players will now have to farm all of the Motes that they want for themselves and any extra motes farmed past Honored will be vendored at . While it's unknown exactly why this was made to be Soulbound, one theory is that it's due to the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/100-gold-per-hour-farm-nerfed-in-wow-forever-383898\">Blackmaw Hold farm</a>. The Devotees dropped a lot of Motes of Unstable Magic, which would have injected a lot of them into the economy.</noscript>            \n        ",
